

# type(scope): imperative subject, at most 72 characters (scope optional)
#
# Why this change, not what (the diff shows what). Wrap at 72.
# Reference issues: Fixes #123 / Refs #123
#
# Types: feat, fix, perf, refactor, test, docs, ci, chore
# Scope: the module or area, e.g. gsUtils, options, manifest, ci
#
# Enable once: git config commit.template .gitmessage
